{
  "command_name": "express_hypothesis",
  "arguments": {
    "hypothesis": "DefaultKeyedValues.removeValue(int) does not rebuild the index map when the removed element is the last one (index == size after removal). This stale indexMap causes incorrect getIndex results and subsequent IndexOutOfBoundsExceptions. The fix is to always call rebuildIndex() after removal, regardless of index position."
  }
}
